@startuml
!theme plain
participant "01 Web" as W
participant "02 API" as A
participant "07 Football Data" as F
database "PostgreSQL football" as D
participant "04 Local AI" as E
W -> A : GET /api/football/predict or simulation
A -> F : proxy football endpoint
F -> D : cached matches / fixtures
D --> F : source data
F -> F : strengths + xG
F -> E : POST /local/predict or simulate
E --> F : probabilities / simulation
F --> A : structured result
A --> W : render result
note over F,E : Chat prediction: 03 calls 07; 06 passthrough formats the answer
@enduml
